anzhong-wyd:p001:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"劉泓","kind":"person","person_id":"p2w_899_b04","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd:p001:m0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"溫","kind":"person","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd:p001:m0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"生","kind":"person","person_id":"wbk_0hg_v5e","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd:p001:m0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"雄","kind":"person","person_id":"o0k_xjc_d5b","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","source_position":{"revision_id":"cbr-ai-transcription-sha256:58a69e8dc3a2f65311cf1c7892835121ced0d516bf455cd18d991fae9cb3a9e8","source_layer":"received_biography","column_projection":[{"pdf_page":22,"half":"右","leaf":"十九下","column_from_right":8,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"衆數萬屯嶢柳愁思塠以距溫遂大戰生親自陷陣殺"},{"pdf_page":22,"half":"右","leaf":"十九下","column_from_right":9,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"溫將應誕劉泓死傷千數溫軍力戰生衆乃散雄又與"}]},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-huanwen:p008","text":"進位太尉，固讓不拜。時殷浩至洛陽修復園陵，經涉數年，屢戰屢敗，器械都盡。溫復進督司州，因朝野之怨，乃奏廢浩，自此內外大權一歸溫矣。溫遂統步騎四萬發江陵，水軍自襄陽入均口。至南鄉，步自淅川以征關中，命梁州刺史司馬勳出子午道。別軍攻上洛，獲苻健荊州刺史郭敬，進擊青泥，破之。健又遣子生、弟雄眾數萬屯嶢柳、愁思塠以距溫，遂大戰，生親自陷陣，殺溫將應庭、劉泓，死傷千數。溫軍力戰，生眾乃散。雄又與將軍桓沖戰白鹿原，又為沖所破。雄遂馳襲司馬勳，勳退次女媧堡。溫進至霸上，健以五千人深溝自固，居人皆安堵復業，持牛酒迎溫于路者十八九，耆老感泣曰：「不圖今日復見官軍！」初，溫恃麥熟，取以為軍資。而健芟苗清野，軍糧不屬，收三千餘口而還。帝使侍中黃門勞溫於襄陽。","source_position":{"kind":"wikitext_codepoint_positions","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-2614273-raw.wikitext","raw_start":9598,"raw_end":9920,"character_positions":[9598,9599,9600,9601,9602,9603,9604,9605,9606,9607,9608,9609,9610,9611,9612,9613,9614,9615,